/* ===== 5 Nov 2026 (Mark): School readiness is 3 weeks, 6 classes. Every other trial gets the recommendation straight away.
   For school readiness, staff can tap "Recommend later" on Today's trials. That saves 'Later' in the Recommendation sent
   column and puts "Send recommendation" in My work for whoever tapped it (and Mark), due around class 4.
   It drops off once a recommendation is marked sent for that contact, or they join. ===== */
